#Lab 3: identify the attacker's ip

## About This Lab

For this lab, I investigated a network traffic capture to identify the IP address associated with suspicious activity.

The exercise introduced me to examining network traffic, identifying communicating devices and understanding how an analyst can use packet information to investigate potential threats.

## What I Worked On

- Examining captured network traffic.
- Identifying suspicious communication.
- Investigating IP addresses within the capture.
- Working through all 10 tasks in the lab.

## What I Learned

This exercise helped me understand how IP addresses can provide useful information during a network investigation and why examining traffic is an important part of identifying suspicious activity.

